  "notes": "{畏敬|いけい} expresses profound respect combined with awe.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {畏敬|いけい}する: to revere, to hold in awe (suru-verb)\n- {畏敬|いけい}の{念|ねん}: a feeling of reverence/awe\n- {畏敬|いけい}の{念|ねん}を{抱|いだ}く: to feel reverence\nCombines {畏|おそ}れ (fear, awe) and {敬|けい} (respect), expressing respect tinged with a sense of something greater than oneself.\n\nREGISTER:\nFormal and literary.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {尊敬|そんけい}: respect (more everyday)\n- {崇拝|すうはい}: worship\n- {敬意|けいい}: respect, homage",
